      <p>Every Veda Apothecary powder starts where these botanicals have grown for centuries — in India — and ends in a resealable pouch shipped from Texas.</p>
      <h2 id="highlights">Highlights</h2><ul class="ba-hl"><li>Sourced at origin in India.</li><li>Milled in small batches.</li><li>Packed in a GMP & ISO certified facility.</li><li>Shipped across the USA from Katy, Texas.</li></ul>
      <h2 id="s0">Sourcing</h2><p>We work with growers in regions where each botanical is traditionally cultivated.</p><h2 id="s1">Milling & packing</h2><p>Botanicals are milled in small batches to protect aroma and colour, then packed into 8 oz resealable pouches with batch, manufacturing and expiry details.</p><h2 id="s2">Shipping</h2><p>Pouches are marketed by Old Soul Goods INC. and shipped across the United States.</p>
      
